# _paperDemo/.gitignore — this project's own rules, applied on top of the repo root's.

# The Co-host archive is a deliberate part of the record, not a regenerable output: CLAIMS v9
# archived the Fe-Co/Fe-Co-B models and _archive/cofe/ holds the frozen values, the evidence
# extract and the archived structures. The repo root ignores `_archive/` wholesale, and also
# `*.csv` / `*.xsf` as regenerable artifacts, so both are re-enabled here for that one directory.
# Verified with `git check-ignore -v`; see _archive/cofe/README.md.
!_archive/
!_archive/cofe/
!_archive/cofe/**.csv
!_archive/cofe/**.xsf
!_archive/cofe/**.md
!_archive/cofe/**.json
!_archive/cofe/**.py
!_archive/cofe/**.png
